INW009   suppression-comment          on     error     default
INW010   unknown-first-party          on     error     default
INW011   dynamic-import               on     error     default
INW012   thin-endpoint                off    warning   opt-in, off by default
INW013   async-blocking               on     error     templates.domain.rules.router; only in src.*.router
INW014   ports-abstract               off    error     opt-in, off by default
INW015   construct-only-in            off    error     opt-in, off by default
INW016   orm-naming                   on     warning   templates.domain.rules.models; severity: templates.domain.rules.models; only in src.*.models
INW017   diagram-unknown-name         off    warning   opt-in, off by default
FAPI001  endpoint-metadata            off    error     opt-in, off by default
FAPI002  undocumented-error-response  off    error     opt-in, off by default
FAPI003  router-wiring                off    error     opt-in, off by default
FAPI005  route-shadowing              off    error     opt-in, off by default
FAPI006  lifespan-events              on     error     rules.extend-select
FAPI007  yield-dependency-swallows    off    error     opt-in, off by default
